"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌\n◎Samurai ELO 8.24\n◎BUBKA  8.31\n◎月刊エンタメ 月末"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かっら、見たください(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台やります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『墓場、女子高生』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出は、劇団鹿殺しの丸尾丸一郎さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"場所は、シアターGロッソです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分も何度も足を運んだことのある場所で\n芝居ができるなんて感慨深い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだなあ(﹡ˆˆ﹡)楽しみしかないなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/12/6785860/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nogizaka46.com/smph/news/2016/08/post-12462.php"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひお越しください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年の「すべての犬は～」で沢山のことを学べたし何より、出演したメンバー全員が本当に仲良し..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、実は昨日も、犬メンの何人かで\n集まってごはんしてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんだけ集まるんだ！仲良しすぎる(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"墓場～でも、この空気をつくっていけるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも引っ張っていけたらいいなあ**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんから突如として送られてきた写真（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/08/12/6785860/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、早寝早起きをすごい頑張ってて、\nめちゃくちゃ寝てるはずなのに\nお昼寝